PICO Sulteng web

The code in this repository is MIT licensed (see LICENSE). The files below are NOT covered by that
licence or have no determined licence.

1. Map boundary files, licence undetermined
   - scripts/geo-src/sulteng.json
   - scripts/geo-src/indonesia.json
   They come from the old PICO project and have been in the repository since 23 May 2020. The original
   author and licence were not recorded. They are used for visualisation only. The simplified paths built
   from them (src/components/maps/geo/) are derived works with the same status. The maps may be replaced
   by BPS boundaries later.

2. Weave (Tenun) motifs, retired and not shipped
   The site no longer shows the Tenun Donggala weave motifs, illustrations or Lottie animations. The files were
   removed from src/assets/brand/ (patterns, illustrations, lottie) and from the brand mirror
   (scripts/sync-brand.mjs). They remain in the PICO brand repository and in this repository's git history. They
   were interpretations drawn from written descriptions, not from photographs of real cloth, and were never
   reviewed by Dinas Kebudayaan Sulawesi Tengah or Dekranasda. The Kaili motifs are communal heritage and not
   owned by PICO. Not for commercial use of the motif. The Metodologi page keeps this caveat.

3. Data (COVID-19 series), not MIT
   Derived from m.andrafarm.com, which allows copy-paste with credit and names no licence. See the
   Metodologi page.

4. Logo, images and fonts
   - PICO logo: the owner's legacy logo (src/assets/brand/logo/, public/favicon.*, public/icon-*.png,
     public/apple-touch-icon-180.png, public/og-image-1200x630.png).
   - Small illustrations of the old PICO dashboard (src/assets/images/: wash hands, wear mask, fever, cough,
     headache), from the owner's legacy-assets. Owner's own work, not MIT.
   - Font Nunito (src/assets/fonts/Nunito-latin.woff2): Copyright 2014 The Nunito Project Authors
     (https://github.com/googlefonts/nunito), SIL Open Font License 1.1. The licence text sits next to the font
